All three done! Here's what was built:

✅ Anchor Links — fully working navigation

Every nav link now points to a real section (#hero, #why-us, #what-we-offer, #how-it-works, #contact)
Smooth scroll with a 80px offset so the fixed header doesn't cover the section title
