✅ PWA Setup — 3 files to upload alongside index.html

File	Purpose
site.webmanifest	App name, icons, theme color, shortcuts
sw.js	Service worker — caches site for offline use
(in index.html)	Auto-registers the service worker
Once live, Android Chrome will show an "Add to Home Screen" prompt automatically. On iOS, users can manually add it via Safari's share menu.

One thing to do: Create icon files in an /icons/ folder on your server — sizes 72, 96, 128, 192, 512px. Use realfavicongenerator.net — it generates all sizes from one image in seconds.

